//RS /// `F32x8`/`F64x4` are the 256-bit forms. Integer lanes cover signed and
//RS /// unsigned 8/16/32/64-bit scalars at both widths. Constructors, splats,
//RS /// indexing, element-wise arithmetic, reductions, and fixed-list bridges all
//RS /// use the same closed compiler-provided family. AOT native builds enable the
